**Autocomplete › Update import (codemod)**

Move the component from the lab to the core. The component is now stable.

```diff
-import Autocomplete from '@mui/lab/Autocomplete';
-import useAutocomplete  from '@mui/lab/useAutocomplete';
+import Autocomplete from '@mui/material/Autocomplete';
+import useAutocomplete from '@mui/material/useAutocomplete';
```

---

**Autocomplete › Update renderOption**

`renderOption` should now return the full DOM structure of the option.
It makes customizations easier. You can recover from the change with:

```diff
 <Autocomplete
-  renderOption={(option, { selected }) => (
-    <React.Fragment>
+  renderOption={(props, option, { selected }) => (
+    <li {...props}>
       <Checkbox
         icon={icon}
         checkedIcon={checkedIcon}
         style={{ marginRight: 8 }}
         checked={selected}
       />
       {option.title}
-    </React.Fragment>
+    </li>
   )}
 />
```

